tml_url":"https://github.com/TokisanGames","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-25T05:10:32Z","updated_at":"2025-02-25T05:10:32Z","body":"TextureArrays lacking mipmaps is the primary thing preventing Terrain3D from supporting D3D12, and probably an easier fix than other tasks. \n\nSince D3D12 is on the list of rendering priorities, it would be to be great to get this into Godot 4.4. Can it have a 4.4 label and a bump in priority? \n\nCc: @clayjohn @Xtarsia ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2680548267/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2681438219","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98527#issuecomment-2681438219","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98527","id":2681438219,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6f04AL","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-25T10:09:49Z","updated_at":"2025-02-25T10:09:49Z","body":"We're in release freeze for 4.4 with the stable release being imminent, so this won't make it.\n\nBut if fixed for 4.5 and the fix is simple, it could likely be cherrypicked.\n\nCC @DarioSamo ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2681438219/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2897562922","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98527#issuecomment-2897562922","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98527","id":2897562922,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6stU0q","user":{"login":"BlueCube3310","id":53150244,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTUwMjQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53150244?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310","html_url":"https://github.com/BlueCube3310","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-21T11:15:03Z","updated_at":"2025-05-21T11:15:03Z","body":"It's a general issue when copying the texture data from the GPU, this is a texture 2d created from a copy of a \"correct\" texture's GPU data:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/413a1c78-ae00-4afb-ab08-6bcb67af0ee2)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2897562922/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2897608499","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98527#issuecomment-2897608499","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98527","id":2897608499,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6stf8z","user":{"login":"BlueCube3310","id":53150244,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTUwMjQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53150244?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310","html_url":"https://github.com/BlueCube3310","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-21T11:32:04Z","updated_at":"2025-05-21T15:08:37Z","body":"It's an issue with `texture_get_copyable_layout`, here are the differences between Vulkan and D3D with the same texture:\n\nVulkan:\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d90bc8f9-8c43-49a8-83f6-5613c3cd9309)\n\nDirectX:\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/29681e8f-90e9-41b3-a778-6340f3489a05)\n\nThe 'offset' field only has a value when the function is called for a set of subresources, otherwise it's 0.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2897608499/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2900764863","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98527#issuecomment-2900764863","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98527","id":2900764863,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6s5ii_","user":{"login":"BlueCube3310","id":53150244,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTUwMjQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53150244?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310","html_url":"https://github.com/BlueCube3310","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-22T10:47:31Z","updated_at":"2025-05-22T10:47:31Z","body":"I modified the code to properly read the offsets, so now the first couple of mipmaps are read correctly. Starting with level 5, however, they appear to be empty:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3179c695-8251-448d-8f45-fde07b2c4258)\n\nI'm not sure how to proceed with this, as it appears to be an issue somewhere deeper in the RenderingDevice internals.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2900764863/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2901009301","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98527#issuecomment-2901009301","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98527","id":2901009301,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6s6eOV","user":{"login":"DarioSamo","id":538504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODUwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/538504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo","html_url":"https://github.com/DarioSamo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-22T12:13:33Z","updated_at":"2025-05-22T12:13:33Z","body":"> I'm not sure how to proceed with this, as it appears to be an issue somewhere deeper in the RenderingDevice internals.\n\n`RenderingDeviceDriverD3D12::texture_get_copyable_layout` would be what you're looking for.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2901009301/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2901965212","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98527#issuecomment-2901965212","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98527","id":2901965212,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6s-Hmc","user":{"login":"BlueCube3310","id":53150244,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTUwMjQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53150244?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310","html_url":"https://github.com/BlueCube3310","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-22T17:02:24Z","updated_at":"2025-05-22T17:02:24Z","body":"> `RenderingDeviceDriverD3D12::texture_get_copyable_layout` would be what you're looking for.\n\nThat's the function I modified. Even after correcting the copyable footprint code, some mip layers refuse to be copied over.\n\nThe modified code is as follows:\n```cpp\n\tTextureInfo *tex_info = (TextureInfo *)p_texture.id;\n\n\tUINT subresource = tex_info->desc.CalcSubresource(p_subresource.mipmap, p_subresource.layer, 0);\n\n\tD3D12_PLACED_SUBRESOURCE_FOOTPRINT footprints[0x64] = {};\n\tUINT64 subresource_total_size = 0;\n\tdevice->GetCopyableFootprints(\n\t\t\t&tex_info->desc,\n\t\t\t0,\n\t\t\tsubresource + 1,\n\t\t\t0,\n\t\t\tfootprints,\n\t\t\tnullptr,\n\t\t\tnullptr,\n\t\t\tnullptr);\n\n\tdevice->GetCopyableFootprints(\n\t\t\t&tex_info->desc,\n\t\t\tsubresource,\n\t\t\t1,\n\t\t\t0,\n\t\t\tnullptr,\n\t\t\tnullptr,\n\t\t\tnullptr,\n\t\t\t&subresource_total_size);\n\n\t*r_layout = {};\n\tr_layout->offset = footprints[subresource].Offset;\n\tr_layout->size = subresource_total_size;\n\tr_layout->row_pitch = footprints[subresource].Footprint.RowPitch;\n\tr_layout->depth_pitch = subresource_total_size / tex_info->desc.Depth();\n\tr_layout->layer_pitch = subresource_total_size / tex_info->desc.ArraySize();\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2901965212/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]